4`** are now templates on `group_heads`, gated by `group_heads_ok()` / updated `shape_ok()`. **`self_attention.hpp`** passes the model’s `operation_kv_mul` at dispatch. The QK kernel’s AVX transpose grows via **`store_transposed_rows`** so all 16 query rows are written; PV/pack loops use `group_heads` instead of a hard-coded 4.\n\nDocs in **`amx_attn_iface.hpp`** describe the generalized contract; **`amx_attn.cpp`** explicitly instantiates 4- and 16-head versions. Tests cover 16-head dispatch, pack layout, QK/PV numerics, and eligibility rejects (e.g. kv_mul 8).\n\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 4c4b7b886485de971b968de579af170d50d73e04. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/positron-ai/tron/issues/comments/6240037919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1210556,"client_id":"Iv23liGzp2hacMWjAyXc","slug":"cursor","node_id":"A_kwHOB44z8s4AEni8","owner":{"login":"cursor","id":126759922,"node_id":"O_kgDOB44z8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126759922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor","html_url":"https://github.com/cursor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.gith